{"seq":1,"slug":"tree-shaking-and-dead-code","title":"Tree-shaking 与死代码消除","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/optimization/tree-shaking-and-dead-code","wordCount":805,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"tree-shaking-与死代码消除\">Tree-shaking 与死代码消除</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Tree-shaking 是构建时的静态优化：打包器通过分析模块的 import/export 关系，判断哪些导出从未被引用，将它们从产物中移除。它成立依赖两个前提——代码使用 ES Modules 的静态结构（import/export 在顶层、路径可静态确定），以及模块声明的副作用能被正确识别。副作用是实践中最容易出问题的一环：一个被 <code>package.json</code> 标为 <code>sideEffects</code> 的模块，或一段在模块顶层执行的副作用代码，都可能阻止剔除。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"什么是-tree-shaking\">什么是 Tree-shaking</h2><p>Tree-shaking 是一种构建时优化技术，通过静态分析模块的导入/导出关系，自动移除最终产物中<strong>未被引用的代码</strong>。这个比喻来源于&quot;摇晃一棵树，让枯死的叶子掉落&quot;——未被使用的导出就是那些&quot;枯叶&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 源码 - 完整的树&#10;        MATH[math.ts&lt;br/&gt;export add&lt;br/&gt;export subtract&lt;br/&gt;export multiply&lt;br/&gt;export divide]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 使用&#10;        APP[app.ts&lt;br/&gt;import add from math]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 产物 - shake 后&#10;        RESULT[bundle.js&lt;br/&gt;只包含 add]&#10;    end&#10;    MATH --&gt; APP --&gt; RESULT&#10;\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 源码 - 完整的树\n        MATH[math.ts&lt;br/&gt;export add&lt;br/&gt;export subtract&lt;br/&gt;export multiply&lt;br/&gt;export divide]\n    end\n    subgraph 使用\n        APP[app.ts&lt;br/&gt;import add from math]\n    end\n    subgraph 产物 - shake 后\n        RESULT[bundle.js&lt;br/&gt;只包含 add]\n    end\n    MATH --&gt; APP --&gt; RESULT\n</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tree-shaking-的前提条件\">Tree-shaking 的前提条件</h2><p>Tree-shaking 并非在所有场景下都能生效。它依赖几个关键前提：</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-es-modules-的静态结构\">1. ES Modules 的静态结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// ✅ 可以 Tree-shake - ESM 的 import/export 是静态的&#10;import { add } from &#39;./math.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;// ❌ 无法 Tree-shake - CommonJS 是动态的&#10;const { add } = require(&#39;./math.js&#39;);&#10;&#10;// ❌ 无法 Tree-shake - 动态导入路径&#10;import(`./${moduleName}.js`);&#10;&#10;// ✅ 可以 Tree-shake - 命名导入&#10;import { specific } from &#39;large-library&#39;;&#10;&#10;// ⚠️ 部分可 shake - 取决于库的实现&#10;import _ from &#39;lodash&#39;; // 整体导入，难以 shake&#10;import map from &#39;lodash-es/map&#39;; // 精确导入，可以 shake\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 可以 Tree-shake - ESM 的 import/export 是静态的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { add } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './math.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 无法 Tree-shake - CommonJS 是动态的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./math.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 无法 Tree-shake - 动态导入路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`./${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">moduleName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.js`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 可以 Tree-shake - 命名导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { specific } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'large-library'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ⚠️ 部分可 shake - 取决于库的实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lodash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 整体导入，难以 shake</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> map </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lodash-es/map'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 精确导入，可以 shake</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-无副作用标记\">2. 无副作用标记</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-library&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sideEffects&quot;: false&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-library\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sideEffects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-library&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sideEffects&quot;: [&quot;*.css&quot;, &quot;*.scss&quot;, &quot;./src/polyfills.ts&quot;, &quot;./src/global-setup.ts&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-library\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sideEffects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*.css\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*.scss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/polyfills.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/global-setup.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"副作用-side-effects-的影响\">副作用（Side Effects）的影响</h2><p>副作用是 Tree-shaking 最大的障碍。如果一个模块在被导入时就会执行某些代码（修改全局变量、发起网络请求、注册事件等），打包器就不敢安全地移除它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// ❌ 有副作用 - 修改全局对象&#10;Array.prototype.customMethod = function () {&#10;  return this.length;&#10;};&#10;export const helper = () =&gt; {};&#10;&#10;// ❌ 有副作用 - 模块顶层执行代码&#10;console.log(&#39;Module loaded!&#39;);&#10;export const utils = {};&#10;&#10;// ✅ 无副作用 - 纯导出&#10;export function add(a, b) {&#10;  return a + b;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function subtract(a, b) {&#10;  return a - b;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 有副作用 - 修改全局对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">prototype</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">customMethod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> helper</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 有副作用 - 模块顶层执行代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Module loaded!'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> utils</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 无副作用 - 纯导出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> subtract</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"_-pure-_-标注\">/<em>#<strong>PURE</strong></em>/ 标注</h3><p>当打包器无法确定一个表达式是否有副作用时，可以使用 <code>/*#__PURE__*/</code> 注释手动标注：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"export const logger = /*#__PURE__*/ createLogger({&#10;  level: &#39;info&#39;,&#10;  prefix: &#39;app&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const theme = /*#__PURE__*/ Object.freeze({&#10;  colors: {&#10;    primary: &#39;#3498db&#39;,&#10;    secondary: &#39;#2ecc71&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> logger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> /*#__PURE__*/</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createLogger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  level: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'info'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prefix: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> theme</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> /*#__PURE__*/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Object.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">freeze</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  colors: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    primary: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#3498db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    secondary: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#2ecc71'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"不同打包器的-tree-shaking-能力\">不同打包器的 Tree-shaking 能力</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Tree-shaking 深度&#10;        STMT[语句级&lt;br/&gt;Rollup]&#10;        MOD[模块级&lt;br/&gt;Webpack 4]&#10;        NESTED[嵌套级&lt;br/&gt;Webpack 5]&#10;        DEEP[深度级&lt;br/&gt;Rollup + Rolldown]&#10;    end&#10;    MOD --&gt; NESTED --&gt; DEEP&#10;    STMT --&gt; DEEP\">graph TB\n    subgraph Tree-shaking 深度\n        STMT[语句级&lt;br/&gt;Rollup]\n        MOD[模块级&lt;br/&gt;Webpack 4]\n        NESTED[嵌套级&lt;br/&gt;Webpack 5]\n        DEEP[深度级&lt;br/&gt;Rollup + Rolldown]\n    end\n    MOD --&gt; NESTED --&gt; DEEP\n    STMT --&gt; DEEP</pre><h3 id=\"webpack-的-tree-shaking-配置\">Webpack 的 Tree-shaking 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// webpack.config.js&#10;export default {&#10;  mode: &#39;production&#39;,&#10;  optimization: {&#10;    usedExports: true,&#10;    minimize: true,&#10;    sideEffects: true,&#10;    concatenateModules: true,&#10;    innerGraph: true,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// webpack.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'production'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  optimization: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    usedExports: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    minimize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sideEffects: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    concatenateModules: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    innerGraph: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>usedExports</code></td>\n<td>标记哪些导出被使用（Dead Code 标记）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>minimize</code></td>\n<td>启用压缩器，移除被标记的死代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sideEffects</code></td>\n<td>读取 package.json 的 sideEffects 字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>concatenateModules</code></td>\n<td>Module Concatenation / Scope Hoisting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>innerGraph</code></td>\n<td>分析函数内部的导出使用关系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"rollup-的-tree-shaking\">Rollup 的 Tree-shaking</h3><p>Rollup 的 Tree-shaking 能力是业界标杆，开箱即用无需额外配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// rollup.config.js&#10;export default {&#10;  input: &#39;src/index.ts&#39;,&#10;  output: { file: &#39;dist/bundle.js&#39;, format: &#39;esm&#39; },&#10;  treeshake: {&#10;    moduleSideEffects: false,&#10;    propertyReadSideEffects: false,&#10;    tryCatchDeoptimization: false,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// rollup.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  input: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  output: { file: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dist/bundle.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'esm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  treeshake: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    moduleSideEffects: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    propertyReadSideEffects: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tryCatchDeoptimization: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tree-shaking-的常见陷阱\">Tree-shaking 的常见陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"陷阱一-重导出-re-exports-的-barrel-文件\">陷阱一：重导出（Re-exports）的 barrel 文件</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// src/components/index.ts (barrel 文件)&#10;export { Button } from &#39;./Button&#39;;&#10;export { Modal } from &#39;./Modal&#39;;&#10;export { Table } from &#39;./Table&#39;;&#10;export { DatePicker } from &#39;./DatePicker&#39;;&#10;export { RichEditor } from &#39;./RichEditor&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/components/index.ts (barrel 文件)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './Button'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Modal } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './Modal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Table } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './Table'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { DatePicker } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './DatePicker'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { RichEditor } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './RichEditor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 消费者&#10;import { Button } from &#39;@my-ui/components&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消费者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@my-ui/components'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果 barrel 文件中的某些组件有副作用（如 CSS 导入），Tree-shaking 可能无法正确移除未使用的组件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ✅ 更安全的做法 - 直接导入&#10;import { Button } from &#39;@my-ui/components/Button&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 更安全的做法 - 直接导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@my-ui/components/Button'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"陷阱二-类和装饰器\">陷阱二：类和装饰器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 类的方法无法被 Tree-shake&#10;class Utils {&#10;  static formatDate(date: Date): string {&#10;    return date.toISOString();&#10;  }&#10;  static formatCurrency(amount: number): string {&#10;    return `$${amount.toFixed(2)}`;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ✅ 独立函数可以被 Tree-shake&#10;export function formatDate(date: Date): string {&#10;  return date.toISOString();&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function formatCurrency(amount: number): string {&#10;  return `$${amount.toFixed(2)}`;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类的方法无法被 Tree-shake</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Utils</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  static</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toISOString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  static</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `$${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 独立函数可以被 Tree-shake</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toISOString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `$${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"陷阱三-commonjs-依赖\">陷阱三：CommonJS 依赖</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// node_modules/legacy-lib/index.js (CommonJS)&#10;module.exports = {&#10;  featureA: function () {},&#10;  featureB: function () {},&#10;  featureC: function () {},&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// node_modules/legacy-lib/index.js (CommonJS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exports</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  featureA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  featureB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  featureC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CommonJS 模块的导出是动态的，打包器难以确定哪些属性被使用。大多数情况下，整个模块都会被保留。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"验证-tree-shaking-效果\">验证 Tree-shaking 效果</h2><h3 id=\"使用-webpack-bundle-analyzer\">使用 webpack-bundle-analyzer</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { BundleAnalyzerPlugin } from &#39;webpack-bundle-analyzer&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    new BundleAnalyzerPlugin({&#10;      analyzerMode: &#39;static&#39;,&#10;      openAnalyzer: false,&#10;      reportFilename: &#39;bundle-report.html&#39;,&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { BundleAnalyzerPlugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'webpack-bundle-analyzer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BundleAnalyzerPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      analyzerMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'static'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      openAnalyzer: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      reportFilename: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bundle-report.html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用-vite-的-rollup-plugin-visualizer\">使用 Vite 的 rollup-plugin-visualizer</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { defineConfig } from &#39;vite&#39;;&#10;import { visualizer } from &#39;rollup-plugin-visualizer&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    visualizer({&#10;      filename: &#39;dist/stats.html&#39;,&#10;      open: true,&#10;      gzipSize: true,&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { visualizer } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rollup-plugin-visualizer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    visualizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      filename: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dist/stats.html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      open: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      gzipSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"编写-tree-shake-友好的代码\">编写 Tree-shake 友好的代码</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>使用 ESM 格式发布</td>\n<td>确保消费者的打包器可以分析静态结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设置 <code>sideEffects: false</code></td>\n<td>告诉打包器你的代码没有副作用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免 barrel 文件中的副作用</td>\n<td>确保 index.ts 只做纯粹的重导出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先使用独立函数而非类方法</td>\n<td>函数级别的 Tree-shaking 更可靠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 <code>/*#__PURE__*/</code> 标注</td>\n<td>帮助打包器识别无副作用的表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提供 <code>module</code> 字段</td>\n<td>在 package.json 中指向 ESM 入口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Tree-shaking 通过静态分析移除未被引用的代码，前提是 ES Modules 的静态结构。</li>\n<li>副作用是 Tree-shaking 的最大障碍，<code>sideEffects</code> 字段和 <code>/*#__PURE__*/</code> 标注是关键工具。</li>\n<li>Rollup 的 Tree-shaking 能力是业界标杆，Webpack 5 通过 innerGraph 显著提升了深度。</li>\n<li>常见陷阱：barrel 文件、类方法、CommonJS 依赖。</li>\n<li>使用 bundle analyzer 工具定期验证 Tree-shaking 效果。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Tree-shaking 与死代码消除","id":"tree-shaking-与死代码消除"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是 Tree-shaking","id":"什么是-tree-shaking"},{"level":2,"text":"Tree-shaking 的前提条件","id":"tree-shaking-的前提条件"},{"level":3,"text":"1. ES Modules 的静态结构","id":"1-es-modules-的静态结构"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 无副作用标记","id":"2-无副作用标记"},{"level":2,"text":"副作用（Side Effects）的影响","id":"副作用-side-effects-的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"/_#**PURE**_/ 标注","id":"_-pure-_-标注"},{"level":2,"text":"不同打包器的 Tree-shaking 能力","id":"不同打包器的-tree-shaking-能力"},{"level":3,"text":"Webpack 的 Tree-shaking 配置","id":"webpack-的-tree-shaking-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Rollup 的 Tree-shaking","id":"rollup-的-tree-shaking"},{"level":2,"text":"Tree-shaking 的常见陷阱","id":"tree-shaking-的常见陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱一：重导出（Re-exports）的 barrel 文件","id":"陷阱一-重导出-re-exports-的-barrel-文件"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱二：类和装饰器","id":"陷阱二-类和装饰器"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱三：CommonJS 依赖","id":"陷阱三-commonjs-依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"验证 Tree-shaking 效果","id":"验证-tree-shaking-效果"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 webpack-bundle-analyzer","id":"使用-webpack-bundle-analyzer"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 Vite 的 rollup-plugin-visualizer","id":"使用-vite-的-rollup-plugin-visualizer"},{"level":2,"text":"编写 Tree-shake 友好的代码","id":"编写-tree-shake-友好的代码"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Turbopack 与 Farm","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/build-frameworks/turbopack-and-farm"},"next":{"title":"代码分割与懒加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/optimization/code-splitting-and-lazy-loading"}}